      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nArtisan Irisi may be found on the second floor of Crescent Reach, at -1350, -1590.\nYou say, 'Hail, Artisan Irisi'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Oh dear, that just won't do. Tell me you have come for [armor] more suited to the Drakkin?'\nYou say, 'I have come for armor more suited to the Drakkin.'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Oh good. You had me worried for a moment. So you are [interested] in some of the armor specifically made for our culture?'\nYou say, 'I am interested.'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Well then, let's get started. You will need various [books] that hold patterns you will need in order to make the armor. There is the [basic] book of armor patterns, and five different books to make [symbols] to augment the efficacy of the armor.'\nYou say, 'What symbols?'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Once you have your armor, you will want to reinforce it with these symbols. Fetch me a few things so I can make the symbol patterns. There's reagents I need in [Crescent Reach], [Dreadlands], [The Dragon Necropolis], and the [valley] beyond the Lavastorm mountains. I have also heard about the [underground] place called Darkhollow.'\nYou say, 'The Dragon Necropolis.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Necropolis Vermin Cleanup'.\nArtisan Irisi says 'There are vermin in the sacred Dragon Necropolis, and I would like for you to remove them. I will also be able to use some of what you retrieve from them as supplies for more books. Remove the rat men from their lairs within Dragon Necropolis, and collect two old dragon horns from them while you are at it. Do you wish to gain this [book]?'\nYou say, 'I wish to gain this book.'\nArtisan Irisi says 'Here is a list of the tasks you will need to complete to get each book. You will only be offered that chance to get books that you will have enough experience to attain.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Necropolis Vermin Cleanup'.\nKill 80 Chelaki or Chetari - Dragon Necropolis\nLoot 2 Old Dragon Horn - Dragon Necropolis\nDeliver 2 Old Dragon Horn to Artisan Irisi - Crescent Reach\nKill 10 Phase Spiders - Dragon Necropolis\nLoot 1 Phase Spider Silk - Dragon Necropolis\nDeliver 1 Phase Spider Silk to Artisan Irisi - Crescent Reach\nUpon completing the last step:\nYou have cleaned some of the vermin from Dragon Necropolis.\nYou receive a Master's Book of Drakkin Culture.Rewards:\n- Sacred Book of Drakkin Culture [item=64709]\n[",
