      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nPearce Icefang in a wolf den in the back of the zone near the mines offers a series of quests for beastlord to obtain a set of \"of the Beastlord\" Armor. He can be found around location 44, -564.\nYou must be at least KINDLY with Coldain in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Pearce Icefang'\nPearce Icefang speaks in a rumbling tone.\nPearce Icefang says, 'Greetings. I only wish to speak to a beastlord. Are you a beastlord?'\nYou say, 'I am a beastlord'\nPearce Icefang says, 'I sense that you are in tune with yourself and with nature. You have learned much from your travels and I shall help you by providing you with protection from harm and the elements in the form of armor.'\nYou say, 'armor'\nPearce Icefang says, 'For you I shall make a cap, tunic, sleeves, bracers, gloves, leggings, and boots. Each piece is a quest unto itself.  To seek the components you must search the lands for them and test the power of the spirit within.'\nEroded Armor molds drop from giants in the Kael Arena. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Eroded Leather Bracelet\nBoots - 3x Crushed Black Marble + Eroded Leather Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Emerald + Eroded Leather Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Eroded Leather Gloves\nHelm - 3x Crushed Coral + Eroded Leather Cap\nLegs - 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire + Eroded Leather Leggings\nChest - 3x Flawless Diamond + Eroded Leather Tunic\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracers'\nPearce Icefang says, 'Bracers are quite easy to imbue. Simply find three crushed flame emeralds and a eroded leather bracelet and I will complete the ritual to enchant them.'\nGive Pearce 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Eroded Leather Wristband\nPearce Icefang smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nPearce Icefang says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Bracer of the Beastlord\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nPearce Icefang says, 'Simply bring me a set of three crushed black marbles and a pair of eroded leather boots and I will imbue them. I bid you good luck in finding such things.'\nGive Pearce 3x Crushed Black Marble and a Eroded Leather Boots\nPearce Icefang smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nPearce Icefang says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Boots of the Beastlord\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nPearce Icefang says, 'Three flawed emeralds and a set of eroded leather sleeves might be an interesting combination. The powers of the gems may be harnessed to imbue the sleeves.'\nGive Pearce 3x Flawed Emerald and a Eroded Leather Sleeves\nPearce Icefang smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nPearce Icefang says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Armband of the Beastlord\nGloves\nYou say, 'gloves'\nPearce Icefang says, 'Strong protection for one's hands is important. I may be able to craft you a set of enchanted leather gloves if you find a set of eroded leather gloves and a set of three crushed topaz.'\nGive Pearce 3x Crushed Topaz and a Eroded Leather Gloves\nPearce Icefang smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nPearce Icefang says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Gloves of the Beastlord\nHelm\nYou say, 'cap'\nPearce Icefang says, 'Those who are wise as we are know that protection of the head is most important. I may be able to sew you something most interesting if you were to bring me an eroded leather cap and three pieces of crushed coral.'\nGive Pearce 3x Crushed Coral and an Eroded Leather Cap\nPearce Icefang smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nPearce Icefang says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Crown of the Beastlord\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nPearce Icefang says, 'Leggings are a bit trickier to imbue. Three flawed sea sapphires will allow me to channel the correct energies into a pair of eroded leather leggings. However, those flawed sea sapphires are somewhat rare. Return to me if you find such things in your journeys.'\nGive Pearce 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and a Eroded Leather Leggings\nPearce Icefang smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nPearce Icefang says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Leggings of the Beastlord\nChest\nYou say, 'tunic'\nPearce Icefang says, 'If you find an eroded leather tunic and three flawless diamonds bring them to me and I shall attempt to create an enchanted tunic that will serve you well.'\nGive Pearce 3x Flawless Diamond and a Corroded Leather Tunic\nPearce Icefang smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nPearce Icefang says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Chestguard of the Beastlord\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Armband of the Beastlord [item=10149]\n- Boots of the Beastlord [item=10334]\n- Bracer of the Beastlord [item=10576]\n- Chestguard of the Beastlord [item=13145]\n- Crown of the Beastlord [item=9009]\n- Gloves of the Beastlord [item=11384]\n- Leggings of the Beastlord [item=8884]\n[",
