      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Vagli'\nAssistant Vagli says 'Greetings, friend. If you have come to study under the great Alvarik you have come to the right place! I help by carrying his research tomes for him. If there is one you would like to buy, feel free to browse through what we have. If you're looking for something to do, I may have a [task] available for you to get started on. Alvarik has much he needs done and I can't do it all myself!'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHe offers you 3 tasks, one of which is 'Dulak Bandits'\nMedium length task, begins in Gulf of Gunthak\nObjective Instructions\n- Speak with Welligorn (Gunthank beach at -205, -672, -34)\n- Explore the ship Stormwave at one of the southern docks (Dulak's Harbor)\n- Kill 10 Broken Skull brigands (Dulak's Harbor - found within the cabins along the south side of the docks)\n- Speak with Zalil Nyvin (Plane of Knowledge - Inside of a building on the north side of PoK south of the Kelethin stone)\nTask description in Quest Journal:\nIt's difficult to keep a farm running on a daily basis, what with all the trouble farmers face today. One thing they can count on is vicious predators on the prowl for their next meal, usually livestock. There's one farmer that's tired of it and wants help. Go speak with Welligorn, for more information.\nUpon hailing Zalil Hyvin;\nThanks for contacting me, ______. Your information on this matter has been most useful.\nYou receive Experience\nYou receive 9 copper\nYou receive 1 silver\nYou receive 7 gold\nYou receive 45 platinumSubmitted by: SentientShamanRewards:\n- Experience, Coin.\n[",
